--- with the adapter:
Run `kubectl delete pod -l app=rancher` in the SUSE Application Collection Pod that runs the old RKE2 controller. This stops the old RKE2 server and its associated pods, which then no longer conflict with the rancher-agent containers. The old RKE2 node is not removed until all of its pods have been stopped or deleted.
